Hi {Owner},

I set up websites and booking for barbershops around {City}. {Business Name} has solid reviews, but nowhere online that shows the prices, the barbers and the wait in one place.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a priced menu, a walk-in queue customers join from their phone, a fade and cut style guide, and a booking button for each barber, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on a slow morning?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
